---
---

<div class="screen-journey p-5 pt-9" style="min-height: 500px;">
  <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between">
    <div>
      <p class="text-[9px] text-[var(--ink-muted)]">Welcome back</p>
      <p class="text-[12px] font-extrabold text-[var(--navy)]">story-demo</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/85 text-[var(--navy)] shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)]">8</div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="font-heading text-[22px] font-extrabold leading-none text-[var(--navy)]">One calm money system</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-[9px] leading-4 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">Track, reflect, plan, and notice patterns without splitting your money life across different tools.</p>

  <div class="mt-4 rounded-[16px] bg-[var(--navy)] p-3 text-white">
    <p class="text-[6px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[1.4px] text-white/55">Next step</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold">Reflect on 3 purchases</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[7px] text-white/65">2 min • Turn recent decisions into useful signal.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
    <div class="rounded-[13px] border border-[rgba(31,47,115,0.08)] bg-white/92 p-3 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)]">
      <p class="text-[7px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[1.2px] text-[var(--ink-muted)]">Transactions</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold text-[var(--navy)]">Spending trail</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-[8px] text-[var(--ink-muted)]">Filters, categories, grouped moments.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-[13px] border border-[rgba(31,47,115,0.08)] bg-white/92 p-3 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)]">
      <p class="text-[7px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[1.2px] text-[var(--ink-muted)]">Budgets</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold text-[var(--navy)]">₱12,055 used</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-[8px] text-[var(--ink-muted)]">62% of monthly cap in range.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-[13px] border border-[rgba(31,47,115,0.08)] bg-white/92 p-3 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)]">
      <p class="text-[7px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[1.2px] text-[var(--ink-muted)]">Insights</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold text-[var(--navy)]">33% regret rate</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-[8px] text-[var(--ink-muted)]">Shopping is heating up lately.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-[13px] border border-[rgba(31,47,115,0.08)] bg-white/92 p-3 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)]">
      <p class="text-[7px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[1.2px] text-[var(--ink-muted)]">Shared household</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold text-[var(--navy)]">Santos Household</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-[8px] text-[var(--ink-muted)]">Owner, PHP, 3 members.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4 rounded-[16px] border border-[rgba(31,47,115,0.08)] bg-white/92 p-3 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)]">
    <p class="text-[7px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[1.2px] text-[var(--ink-muted)]">Receipt scan</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold text-[var(--navy)]">Snap it. Review it. Done.</p>
    <div class="mt-2 flex gap-2 text-[7px] font-semibold text-[var(--navy)]">
      <span class="rounded-full bg-[rgba(233,237,255,0.7)] px-2 py-1">Merchant</span>
      <span class="rounded-full bg-[rgba(233,237,255,0.7)] px-2 py-1">Total</span>
      <span class="rounded-full bg-[rgba(233,237,255,0.7)] px-2 py-1">Category</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
